[ti:The Shape of Light]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:08.52]Some things don’t vanish
[00:10.08]They just change rooms
[00:12.38]Move through the morning
[00:13.60]Soften what we do
[00:14.84]Not a ghost
[00:15.70]Not a wound
[00:16.38]Not a name I have to write
[00:17.72]Just a line in the silence
[00:19.24]Learning the shape of light
[00:20.54]A little more air
[00:21.90]In the ordinary day
[00:23.28]A little less weight
[00:24.64]When the shadows change
[00:25.92]I don’t need to hold it
[00:27.52]I don’t need to know
[00:28.60]Why something keeps shining
[00:30.16]After letting go
[00:31.48]The shape of light
[00:33.64]Turning in the air
[00:36.50]Not asking
[00:38.34]To be held
[00:39.12]Only to be there
[00:43.26]The shape of light
[00:44.70]Soft against the blue
[00:47.40]Changing
[00:48.76]Every shadow
[00:50.22]It passes through
[00:52.80]I see it in windows
[00:56.20]Before the city wakes
[00:57.36]In the small quiet mercy
[00:58.96]An ordinary moment makes
[01:00.44]A cup on the table
[01:01.86]A sky opening wide
[01:03.26]A thought comes gently
[01:04.60]And sits by my side
[01:05.94]No answer
[01:06.66]No sign
[01:07.32]No reason to explain
[01:08.68]Some things return softly
[01:10.32]In a different frame
[01:11.48]Not gone
[01:12.22]Not mine
[01:12.84]Not frozen in time
[01:14.22]Just moving through everything
[01:15.76]Like weather
[01:16.26]Like light
[01:17.46]The shape of light
[01:19.26]Turning in the air
[01:21.94]Not asking
[01:23.38]To be held
[01:24.70]Only to be there
[01:28.64]The shape of light
[01:30.32]Soft against the blue
[01:32.88]Changing
[01:34.16]Every shadow
[01:35.68]It passes through
[01:38.16]
[01:40.60]Some love becomes weather
[01:42.48]Some silence learns to glow
[01:45.04]Some doors remain open
[01:48.30]Even when we go
[02:01.98]The shape of light
[02:03.04]Turning in the air
[02:06.10]Not asking
[02:07.32]To be held
[02:08.52]Only to be there
[02:12.62]The shape of light
